{
  "assessment_scope": "Fresh final whole-change Code Review of 5c4bda94..ff9154a6, including M1 shared preparation, M2 coordinated removal, documentation consolidation and their integrated interactions. The suffix through 1f44e053 contains only the new Design assessment and Route bookkeeping. Current design-consolidation-review and unchanged approved primary Delivery allocation are the engineering authority; prior final-code-review is historical and explicitly stale.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-11-retire-v2-record-format",
